# app: read
# P3-6 (simulator): power-off while reading. The sleep screen shows the book with its cover and progress; the next boot opens the
# book again on the same page.
wait 600
tap 270 178
wait 1500
tap 400 500
wait 900
tap 400 500
wait 900
tap 400 500
wait 900
shot sleep-reader-page
expect-state page=4/
power-off
shot sleep-reader
restart
wait 2000
expect-state page=4/
shot sleep-reader-resumed
expect-shot-equal sleep-reader-page sleep-reader-resumed
